## Notes

- **Fire-and-forget recovery:** Runs on separate background thread after startup
- **Graceful degradation:** Persistence failures don't block app startup
- **History retention:** 30-day cleanup policy reduces DB growth
- **Resumption:** Workflows resume from last checkpoint (activity level)

